{"id": "EUVD-2026-104401", "enisaUuid": "8230d290-35d8-3cea-9425-349e93be7be7", "description": "@rvf/set-get before 7.0.4 contains a prototype pollution vulnerability in setPath that allows unauthenticated attackers to overwrite properties of shared built-in functions via inherited Object.prototype methods. Attackers can submit a form field named hasOwnProperty.call through @rvf/core form parsing to replace the shared function property, causing process-wide denial of service until restart.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T15:28:58", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T03:00:39", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/airjp73/rvf/commit/4a5e118667549ac41f065b4cfa80b995841c3811", "https://github.com/airjp73/rvf/blob/61172ff01bf1250893108e5c80f35b5ac0388ecb/packages/set-get/src/setPath.ts", "https://github.com/airjp73/rvf/blob/61172ff01bf1250893108e5c80f35b5ac0388ecb/packages/core/src/native-form-data/flatten.ts", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/rvf-set-get-before-7.0.4-prototype-pollution-via-setpath-inherited-methods"], "aliases": ["GHSA-ffhp-5372-ccmj", "CVE-2026-112309"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.4, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6056446f-fd3e-37a6-a821-4e20a90ee8ff", "product": {"name": "@rvf/set-get", "vendor": {"name": "airjp73"}}, "product_version": "0 <7.0.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "48ea4799-0622-3783-85ed-48f6ce93667e", "vendor": {"name": "airjp73"}}], "isExploited": false}